{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-02-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES EXPANDS FINNAIR CODESHARE AGREEMENT FOR DEEPER GLOBAL REACH', 'text': "SEATTLE, FEB. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALASKA AIRLINES HAS ANNOUNCED TODAY A SIGNIFICANT CODESHARE EXPANSION WITH OUR EUROPEAN ONEWORLD PARTNER FINNAIR, THE LATEST IN A SERIES OF PARTNERSHIP EXPANSIONS FOR ALASKA SINCE JOINING THE GLOBAL ALLIANCE IN MARCH 2021. BEGINNING NOW, FINNAIR PASSENGERS CAN BOOK CONNECTING FLIGHTS THROUGH SEATTLE – OUR HOMETOWN AIRPORT – TO MORE THAN 60 DESTINATIONS THROUGHOUT ALASKA'S NETWORK FOR TRAVEL BEGINNING JUNE 1, 2022."}